	•	Section 1 Comments/Quotes: This was a “retrospective cohort study from a multicenter hospital system in the United States,” using EHR data from three hospitals in the greater Chicago area queried “from January 1, 2000, to March 10, 2021.” Because it spans all adult solid organ transplants rather than a single thoracic organ, organ focus is best classified as Other. I did not identify an explicit funding or COI statement in the retrieved text.  ￼

